                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "The owners are incredibly friendly and didn\u0027t get grumpy even when it was crowded! Everything was so affordable and you could order with confidence! A meal for two people, including one large and one small wonton noodle soup, braised pork rice, two fried tofu sheets, two bean curd sheets, two seaweed dishes, and an extra serving of pork skin, only cost 200 yuan. It\u0027s unbelievably cheap! We even took some home for dinner! I saw many people ordering sesame sauce noodles, so I\u0027ll try them next time! We arrived at 12 pm and waited 40 minutes for our food. It was very crowded, and the owners are older and a bit slow, so be patient and don\u0027t rush them!",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "老闆與老闆娘超親切，不會因為人多擺臭臉！所有東西都放心點下去超便宜！2人吃一大一小餛飩麵、小滷肉飯、炸豆腐*2、豆皮*2、海帶*2、再一份豬皮一共才200元，不用懷疑真的很便宜，吃不完還打包回家晚餐吃！看很多人點麻醬麵下次來吃看看！我們12點到店等了40分鐘才上菜人很多，老闆與闆娘年紀大了動作有點慢，要有耐心別催促！",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
